			"notes": "## Changes\n- **Trophy Frog HUD:** the time estimates until Gold and Diamond pity now use your catch rate over up to the last hour on the Lotus Atoll instead of the last 10 minutes, so they're much steadier, especially for rarer frogs. Older catches drop out after an hour; nothing resets until you restart the game or switch profiles.\n\n## Changes since v1.1.1\n\n### New features\n- Measure the Trophy Frog catch rate over up to an hour (#95)\n\n### Other\n- Set mod_version to 1.2.0 for the next release (#96)"
		},
